PLACEHOLDER — replace this file with a real short adhan sound clip.

Requirements for iOS notification sounds:
  • Format: CAF, AIFF, or WAV (Linear PCM, MA4, µ-law, or a-law)
  • Duration: under 30 seconds (longer sounds fall back to the default)
  • Keep the filename "adhan.caf" (referenced in NotificationManager.swift),
    or update the reference there if you rename it.

Convert an mp3/wav to caf with, e.g.:
  afconvert input.wav adhan.caf -d ima4 -f caff

Until replaced, iOS ignores this invalid file and uses the default sound.
